    "content": "Growth is expected to weaken to 2.3 percent in 2025—a significant downgrade from previous forecasts—with only a tepid recovery expected in 2026-27. Growth could ...",
    "raw_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n     \n\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n\n  <script defer=\"defer\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://rum.hlx.page/.rum/@adobe/helix-rum-js@%5E2/dist/micro.js\" data-routing=\"env=prod,tier=publish,ams=World Bank\"></script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/content/dam/wbr-redesign/logos/favicon.ico\">\n\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/content/dam/wbr-redesign/logos/wbg-favicon.png?v=10\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"192x192\" href=\"/content/dam/wbr-redesign/logos/favicon-192x192.png?v=10\">\n\n<!--<link rel='icon' href='/content/dam/wbr/social-icon/favicon.svg?v=3' type='image/svg+xml'>-->\n     <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://worldbank.scene7.com/\" crossorigin>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\"/>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <title>Global Economic Prospects</title>\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Global Economics Prospects (GEP), Economic Growth\"/>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The latest global economic outlook for 2025 from the World Bank. Learn about economic trends, policies, GDP growth, risks, and inflation rates affecting the world economy, stability, and development.\"/> \n    <meta name=\"language\" content=\"en\"/>\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href='https://www.worldbank.org/en/publication/global-economic-prospects'/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Global Economic Prospects\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"World Bank\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The latest global economic outlook for 2025 from the World Bank. Learn about economic trends, policies, GDP growth, risks, and inflation rates affecting the world economy, stability, and development.\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:test\" content=\"https://www.worldbank.org/content/dam/wbr/share-lo